<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>데이터 목록을 가진 텍스트 입력</title>
</head>
<body>
<h3>가보고 싶은 곳</h3>
<hr>
<form>
나라 : <input type="text" list="countries"><br>
        <datalist id="countries">
          <option value="가나">
          <option value="스위스">
          <option value="브라질">
        </datalist>
보고싶은것 : <input type="text" list="what"><br>
      <datalist id="what">
        <option value="산">
        <option value="바다">
        <option value="도시">
      </datalist>
</form>
</body>
</html>


